      "writtenOn": "2022-08-17T13:53:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Outside of all of these comments I\u0027ve thought about this overnight and I think another approach may be better -- re-enabling perspective SDF text support. There\u0027s a check in SmallPathRenderer that determines the scale of the base SDF for perspective, and I think we could move it over to the text renderer.",
      "revId": "15f4aa9a8e0f3d43d0a615600e20b93b832786a8",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
