        "id": 5065
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-08-17T13:53:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As written, yes -- but as you say below we need to figure out what\u0027s going on with the GetString issue. I also need to change this to not disable on Adreno 4xx in general. I don\u0027t believe this bug happens when using GLES directly, otherwise it would have come up by now.",
      "parentUuid": "139557cd_d5d1a129",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4224,
        "startChar": 46,
        "endLine": 4224,
        "endChar": 52
      },
      "revId": "15f4aa9a8e0f3d43d0a615600e20b93b832786a8",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a2ed0534_4ca0f2d1",
        "filename": "src/gpu/ganesh/gl/GrGLCaps.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 4225,
      "author": {
        "id": 5085
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-08-17T13:39:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We should probably add a condition to check for GrGLDriver::kQualcomm to avoid triggering on Freedreno driver. Not that it\u0027s likely to encounter a freedreno running on 4xx on a real device, but at least it\u0027ll be there for future copy-pasta.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4225,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 4225,
        "endChar": 15
      },
      "revId": "15f4aa9a8e0f3d43d0a615600e20b93b832786a8",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
