        "id": 5065
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-08-17T13:53:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ll be removing the non WebGL case, as above. There\u0027s no way that I can tell to get access to the driver information through WebGL, just the vendor and the renderer.",
      "parentUuid": "a2ed0534_4ca0f2d1",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4225,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 4225,
