        "id": 5085
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-08-17T13:39:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hm, seems like we need to get to the bottom of this. When I go to webglreport.com I get \"ANGLE (Apple, Apple M1 Pro, OpenGL 4.1)\" so it seems like it ought to work in Chrome. Could it be something in the emscripten GL-\u003eWebGL layer?",
      "parentUuid": "3c573b47_5662c03a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 705,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 705,
        "endChar": 76
      },
      "revId": "15f4aa9a8e0f3d43d0a615600e20b93b832786a8",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "616c2e1a_fa4c2618",
        "filename": "src/gpu/ganesh/gl/GrGLUtil.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 705,
      "author": {
        "id": 5065
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-08-17T13:53:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s likely but I\u0027m not sure who to ask. Kevin doesn\u0027t seem to know.",
      "parentUuid": "d0f6b9bd_d8ed3a01",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 705,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 705,
