      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-08-17T13:55:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I can look into this more today if you like. I think I know where to put breakpoints etc to maybe get more info",
      "parentUuid": "616c2e1a_fa4c2618",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 705,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 705,
