      "writtenOn": "2022-08-17T18:23:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Jim and I discovered that emscripten does not have WEBGL_debug_renderer_info enabled by default, even when it is available. \n\nhttps://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten/blob/fb83ec814d4774a0c50601186cd9aee6e680c59f/src/library_webgl.js#L1129\n\nBy enabling it in webgl.js before we pass the WebGL context into GrContext, that seems to make this return a non-empty string.",
      "parentUuid": "f4d224b7_ec77897b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 705,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 705,
        "endChar": 76
